# ===================================================================
# PathFinder - Open-Source Environment Configuration
# ===================================================================
# PathFinder is 100% open-source and free!
# It uses OpenStreetMap, Nominatim Geocoding, and OSRM Routing.
#
# NO GOOGLE CLOUD ACCOUNT, CREDIT CARD, OR API KEYS REQUIRED.
#
# Simply run:
#   cd frontend
#   npm.cmd run dev
#
# The application will start immediately at http://localhost:5173
# ===================================================================
